Thank you very, very much Matthew. I think this is a very valuable (at least
to me), and unique feature for more powerful calculation. A very useful
application I can immediately think of is for options chains and order book
modeling. It's much easier to track and model the whole option chains or
order book for each time stamp or symbol, and also save a lot of
replicating time stamps and symbols.

